{"seq":2,"slug":"front-estimate-confidence-badge","title":"前台预估精度与可信度展示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/landed-cost-ddp-buyer-experience/landed-cost-estimation/front-estimate-confidence-badge","wordCount":2363,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"前台预估精度与可信度展示\">前台预估精度与可信度展示</h1><p>看两个真实的结账页：A 站显示「总计 94.01 欧元（含进口税费 15.01 欧）」，B 站显示「商品 79 欧 + 预估税费约 12–18 欧」。用户对 A 的信任度高得多，对 B 则会在心里打一个问号，甚至因为不愿承担不确定性而放弃下单。但如果实际税费是 21 欧，A 站就从一个可信的页面变成了一个说谎的页面，而 B 站只是预估偏保守。这一篇讨论的就是这个张力：<strong>预估必然有误差，问题不在于消除误差，而在于如何把一个带误差的数字诚实地表达出来，同时不违反「总价必须披露」的法规要求</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>可信度不是金额的函数，而是输入质量的函数</strong>：同一个百分比的误差在高可信订单与低可信订单上含义不同，分级依据应当是 HS 是否审定、是否有历史实际税单、金额是否远离门槛。</li>\n<li><strong>误差要分方向与尾部分别度量</strong>：偏差（Bias）反映系统性低估或高估，分位误差反映突破容差的概率，两者不能互相替代。</li>\n<li><strong>区间不是免责声明</strong>：区间必须按分位数构造、且与承诺在视觉上分离，消费者保护规则要求总价及其组成部分在成交前可获知。</li>\n<li><strong>分级只影响展示，不影响记账</strong>：后台始终按快照的精确值预收与核销，分级仅决定向买家承诺的强度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"预估误差的四个来源\">预估误差的四个来源</h2><p>在讨论表达之前先量化输入。前一篇定义的快照里有若干字段，每个都可能偏离最终实际值，偏离的方式各不相同，需要分开度量——混在一起只能得到一个无法行动的总体差异率。</p>\n<h3 id=\"归类误差-离散且跳跃\">归类误差：离散且跳跃</h3><p>HS 编码由系统按商品描述、标题、图片和类目路径推断。归类的特点是<strong>误差不连续</strong>：同一个商品从 <code>6403.99</code> 改判到 <code>6404.19</code>，税率可能从 8% 跳到 16.9%。这意味着归类误差不能用「平均差几块钱」来度量，它更接近一个分类正确率指标，其尾部直接决定最坏情况。</p>\n<h3 id=\"估价误差-偏低为主\">估价误差：偏低为主</h3><p>平台用自己的成交价做基础，而海关可能加计运费、保险或特许权使用费，也可能因关联交易或价格附条件而直接改用替代方法（见 <a href=\"landed-cost-component-build\">落地价构成与计算口径</a>）。由于平台往往希望在结账页显得便宜，估价误差的方向性通常偏向低估，这是需要人为加一层保守系数的原因。</p>\n<h3 id=\"汇率与运费误差-小但持续\">汇率与运费误差：小但持续</h3><p>运费报价有有效期，下单时冻结的运费与出运时实际运费可能不同；汇率在申报月会被重算。这两项单笔影响通常有限，但发生频率高，是长期累积偏差的主要成分。</p>\n<h3 id=\"门槛误判-量级最大\">门槛误判：量级最大</h3><p>当订单金额恰好落在免税门槛附近时，判断错误会让税费从「接近零」跳到「完整税额」，差异幅度可达订单金额的 20% 以上。门槛规则本身也会变——例如英国自 2021 年 1 月 1 日起对 135 英镑以下的货物要求卖家在销售时点收取增值税，同时取消了原有的 15 英镑低值免税安排（<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/vat-and-overseas-goods-sold-directly-to-customers-in-the-uk\">GOV.UK: VAT and overseas goods sold to customers in the UK</a>）。门槛附近应当触发单独的判定逻辑，而不是沿用连续误差的处理方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可信度分级-把不确定性显性化\">可信度分级：把不确定性显性化</h2><p>与其给所有订单同一套展示模板，不如按预估可信度分级。分级的依据是输入质量，而不是金额大小。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>展示方式</th>\n<th>兜底策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>HS 已审定、有历史实际税单、金额远离门槛</td>\n<td>精确含税总价</td>\n<td>差额由平台吸收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>HS 由模型推断但置信度高、有同类目历史</td>\n<td>精确总价 + 差异说明钩子</td>\n<td>容差内吸收，超容差走退款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>HS 置信度低、品类首次出现、金额贴近门槛</td>\n<td>区间价或明确「税费到付」提示</td>\n<td>不在线承诺，转 DDU 或人工审核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未知</td>\n<td>缺优惠券、缺地址精度、识别不到归类</td>\n<td>展示净价 + 到付说明</td>\n<td>不承诺总价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分级的关键约定是：<strong>级别只影响前台表达，不影响后台记账</strong>。后台始终按快照里的精确估值记账与预收，级别仅决定向买家承诺的口径有多强。</p>\n<h2 id=\"区间表达的设计\">区间表达的设计</h2><p>当可信度为低时，给区间比给单值诚实，但区间的画法有讲究。</p>\n<h3 id=\"区间要按分位数而非正负百分比\">区间要按分位数而非正负百分比</h3><p>常见的偷懒做法是「预估值 ±15%」。这让区间宽度与真实不确定性脱钩——一件税率 2% 的低关税商品和一个税率 20% 的商品，误差分布形态完全不同。正确做法是按品类与贸易通道维护误差分布，取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>10</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>90</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{90}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">90</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 作为区间端点：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0.10</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0.90</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\hat{T}] = \\left[Q_{0.10}(T \\mid c, m),\\ Q_{0.90}(T \\mid c, m)\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.90</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是品类，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 是目的地市场与贸易通道。区间端点随实际税单回流不断重估。</p>\n<h3 id=\"区间与承诺必须在视觉上分离\">区间与承诺必须在视觉上分离</h3><p>如果页面同时出现「预估 12–18 欧」和「总计 94.01 欧」两个数字，用户会取自己偏好的那个理解，争议仍在。可行做法是把区间放在税费行，把「总计」行明确标注为「按预估上限计」或「以实际为准」。法规层面要求的是总价及其组成部分在成交前可获知且不含隐藏加价，额外收费须经消费者明示同意——欧盟消费者权利指令禁止预先勾选的增项并禁止未经明示同意的额外支付（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Consumer_Rights_Directive_2011\">Consumer Rights Directive 2011/83/EU</a>）。区间表达因此不能变成「到货再加价」的挡箭牌。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预估精度怎么衡量\">预估精度怎么衡量</h2><h3 id=\"误差分位与偏差分开看\">误差分位与偏差分开看</h3><p>对误差序列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>actual</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>estimate</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_i = T_{\\text{actual}} - T_{\\text{estimate}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">actual</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">estimate</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，至少报告四个量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Bias</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>MAPE</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>actual</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Bias} = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n} e_i, \\qquad \\text{MAPE} = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\left|\\frac{e_i}{T_{\\text{actual}}}\\right|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bias</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"m