:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"decile\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"unknown\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"require\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"hs_confidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"&#x3C;0.60\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"display\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"net_price_ddu_notice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"error_model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"group_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"category\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dest_country\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"trade_lane\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min_sample\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"refresh\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"daily\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>配置里 <code>absorb_tolerance</code> 是平台愿意为体验买下的误差幅度：容差内的差额不打扰买家，由平台吸收或从准备金中列支。这个阈值是成本与体验的直接取舍，具体数值应在成本模型（见 <a href=\"../ddp-experience-ops/ddp-margin-cost-model\">DDP 定价与成本建模</a>）中论证，而不是拍脑袋。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么时候应当放弃在线承诺\">什么时候应当放弃在线承诺</h2><p>有一种情况不该给出任何总价承诺：当订单的归类无法在合理时间内确定，或目的地的门槛与征收规则正处于变更窗口期。此时把模式切换为到付（DDU/DAP）比给出一个大概率错误的含税价更诚实。这属于模式选择问题，判断框架见 <a href=\"../ddp-ddu-mode/ddp-vs-ddu-choice-conversion\">DDP 与 DDU 的模式选择</a>；门槛本身的规则细节见 <a href=\"deminimis-threshold-ioss-dmp-link\">小额免税门槛与代收通道衔接</a>。</p>\n<p>一句总结：可信度分级要回答的不是「这个数字准不准」，而是「我们对这个数字的把握有多大，以及愿意为这份把握的对错付多少代价」。把这两件事分开，展示策略才有依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>四类误差要分开度量：归类是离散跳跃、估价以偏低为主、汇率运费小但持续、门槛误判量级最大；混在一起只能得到一个无法行动的差异率。</li>\n<li>可信度分四级（高/中/低/未知），依据是输入质量而非金额大小；分级只改变前台表达，不改变后台记账。</li>\n<li>低可信度订单给区间而非单值，区间按品类与通道的误差分位构造，并与承诺在视觉上分离。</li>\n<li>衡量精度时 Bias 与分位误差并用，指标按品类、市场、通道切片报告，切片结果直接驱动分级阈值。</li>\n<li>当归类无法确定或规则处于变更窗口时，放弃在线承诺、切到到付表达，比给出一个大概率错误的含税价更诚实。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>做完展示层，下一个问题是这个被展示出来的总价对应谁的付款义务——见 <a href=\"../ddp-ddu-mode/ddp-vs-ddu-choice-conversion\">DDP 与 DDU 的模式选择</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"前台预估精度与可信度展示","id":"前台预估精度与可信度展示"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"预估误差的四个来源","id":"预估误差的四个来源"},{"level":3,"text":"归类误差：离散且跳跃","id":"归类误差-离散且跳跃"},{"level":3,"text":"估价误差：偏低为主","id":"估价误差-偏低为主"},{"level":3,"text":"汇率与运费误差：小但持续","id":"汇率与运费误差-小但持续"},{"level":3,"text":"门槛误判：量级最大","id":"门槛误判-量级最大"},{"level":2,"text":"可信度分级：把不确定性显性化","id":"可信度分级-把不确定性显性化"},{"level":2,"text":"区间表达的设计","id":"区间表达的设计"},{"level":3,"text":"区间要按分位数而非正负百分比","id":"区间要按分位数而非正负百分比"},{"level":3,"text":"区间与承诺必须在视觉上分离","id":"区间与承诺必须在视觉上分离"},{"level":2,"text":"预估精度怎么衡量","id":"预估精度怎么衡量"},{"level":3,"text":"误差分位与偏差分开看","id":"误差分位与偏差分开看"},{"level":3,"text":"指标要按切片报告","id":"指标要按切片报告"},{"level":2,"text":"展示层的落地结构","id":"展示层的落地结构"},{"level":2,"text":"什么时候应当放弃在线承诺","id":"什么时候应当放弃在线承诺"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"落地价构成与计算口径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/landed-cost-ddp-buyer-experience/landed-cost-estimation/landed-cost-component-build"},"next":{"title":"小额免税门槛与代收通道衔接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/landed-cost-ddp-buyer-experience/landed-cost-estimation/deminimis-threshold-ioss-dmp-link"}}